WEBVTT

00:04:28.636 --> 00:04:32.396
"This longing you express
is the return message.

00:04:32.436 --> 00:04:35.396
The grief you cry out from
draws you toward union.

00:04:35.716 --> 00:04:39.316
Your pure sadness that wants help
is the secret cup."

00:04:40.716 --> 00:04:43.276
And I have this taped up in my office

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:45.476
because I believe that ...

00:04:46.356 --> 00:04:47.916
I believe that that's the truth,

00:04:47.956 --> 00:04:51.756
whether we consider ourselves atheists
or believers or somewhere in between.

00:04:51.796 --> 00:04:53.396
To me, is a false dichotomy.

00:04:54.996 --> 00:04:56.556
WPR: It's beautiful.

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:58.916
Can you share a little bit more
about the process

00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:00.676
that went into writing this book